<title>USA: Emcor Group adopts shareholder rights plan.</title>
<headline>Emcor Group adopts shareholder rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>NORWALK, Conn. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Emcor Group Inc said its board has adopted a shareholder rights plan designed to provide protection against coercive or unfair takeover tactics.</p>
<p>The company said the adoption of the rights plan should provide a sound and reasonable means of safeguarding the interests of all shareholders.</p>
<p>The distribution of the rights will be made on March 14, payable to shareholders of record at the close of business on that date. The rights will expire on March 3, 2007.</p>
</text>
